{"id":"41fdad0bfaff0bf5","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md","title":"用表示图而非未声明函数项构造对角句","display":"thm-diagonal-lemma — 用表示图而非未声明函数项构造对角句","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-diagonal-lemma","aliases":["91-thm-diagonal-lemma","91-thm-fixed-point-lemma"],"display":"thm-diagonal-lemma — 用表示图而非未声明函数项构造对角句","depends_on":["[[91-df-diagonal-function]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-diagonal-lemma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-diagonal-lemma</span><span>91-thm-fixed-point-lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-diagonal-lemma — 用表示图而非未声明函数项构造对角句"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b31ce2c72a177855\" href=\"?note=b31ce2c72a177855\" title=\"91-df-diagonal-function\">91-df-diagonal-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\supseteq\\mathrm Q\">\\(S\\supseteq\\mathrm Q\\)</span> 为经典理论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 是已自然编码的递归语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{diag}\">\\(\\operatorname{diag}\\)</span> 为数字自代入编码函数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D(x,y)\">\\(D(x,y)\\)</span> 表示其图，满足每个标准 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\vdash\\forall y(D(\\overline n,y)\\leftrightarrow y=\\overline{\\operatorname{diag}(n)})\">\\(S\\vdash\\forall y(D(\\overline n,y)\\leftrightarrow y=\\overline{\\operatorname{diag}(n)})\\)</span>。自然 PA 表示满足此条件。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(y)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\theta(y)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 至多以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 自由，变量选择避免捕获。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\\quad\n\\exists\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\n[S\\vdash\\gamma\\leftrightarrow\\theta(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\\quad\n\\exists\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\n[S\\vdash\\gamma\\leftrightarrow\\theta(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta(x)=\\exists y(D(x,y)\\land\\theta(y))\">\\(\\delta(x)=\\exists y(D(x,y)\\land\\theta(y))\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=\\ulcorner\\delta\\urcorner\">\\(a=\\ulcorner\\delta\\urcorner\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma=\\delta(\\overline a)\">\\(\\gamma=\\delta(\\overline a)\\)</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{diag}(a)=\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner\">\\(\\operatorname{diag}(a)=\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner\\)</span>。图表示的标准实例给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\vdash D(\\overline a,y)\\leftrightarrow y=\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner}\">\\(S\\vdash D(\\overline a,y)\\leftrightarrow y=\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner}\\)</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span> 的存在式即得结论。\n旧构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(x,x))\">\\(\\theta(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(x,x))\\)</span> 只有在已扩充对应对象函数符号时才合式；新证明对只给出表示公式的语言也适用。对角等价是经典理论可证式，不自动保证任意生成句的三值同值。</p>\n<p>来源：§5.1 的自然表示与 §6 的对角方法；本节点展开标准图表示证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-diagonal-function","status":"resolved","id":"b31ce2c72a177855","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-diagonal-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\supseteq\\mathrm Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{diag}","display":false},{"tex":"D(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"S\\vdash\\forall y(D(\\overline n,y)\\leftrightarrow y=\\overline{\\operatorname{diag}(n)})","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta(y)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\\quad\n\\exists\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\n[S\\vdash\\gamma\\leftrightarrow\\theta(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})].","display":true},{"tex":"\\delta(x)=\\exists y(D(x,y)\\land\\theta(y))","display":false},{"tex":"a=\\ulcorner\\delta\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma=\\delta(\\overline a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{diag}(a)=\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"S\\vdash D(\\overline a,y)\\leftrightarrow y=\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner}","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(x,x))","display":false}],"bytes":1739,"backlinks":[{"id":"719296019c11ec36","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ec1d9c6fcc3c0767","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"性质中的公式量化与 $S\\vdash$ 都在元层。由对角引理，所给算术背景满足本性质；详见 [[91-thm-diagonal-lemma]] 的构造。\n旧定义把未说明的 $\\operatorname{Rep}_S(\\operatorname{diag})$ 合取进性质，混淆证明所用的可表示性条件与结论性质。现已移除这一未定义黑箱。\n经典 PA 可证的双条件并不自动成为强 Kleene 语义中的透明等价。分析三值说谎者时须使用 [[91-df-liar-sentence]] 的闭项直接自指构造。"},{"id":"78bf2ec267a1c34b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5f78118711a12b83","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"54f6107246f40c19","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Diag}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal S)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\theta(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\\;\n\\exists\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\;\n[\\mathcal S\\vdash\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\theta(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})]$；\n这是 [[91-thm-diagonal-lemma]] 在基础语言中的固定点性质。"},{"id":"567189f4b7e57f6f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c289f1c721012496","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-126","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-140","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md]]\n[[91-thm-revision-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-soundness-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-iteration-stability.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability.md]]\n[[91-thm-typed-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-untyped-nonconservative.md]]"}],"outgoing":["b31ce2c72a177855","822ef14bbd4e020d"]}